    "Checks Zoom and Teams sharing toolbar titles using Accessibility. Client versions and languages may not match. System sharing, remote desktop, recording and browser tabs are not covered. Enable manual protection before important sharing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Checks Zoom and Teams sharing toolbar titles using Accessibility. Client versions and languages may not match. System sharing, remote desktop, recording and browser tabs are not covered. Enable manual protection before important sharing."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vérifie les titres des barres de partage de Zoom et Teams via Accessibilité. Les versions et langues des clients peuvent ne pas correspondre. Le partage système, le bureau distant, l’enregistrement et les onglets ne sont pas couverts. Activez la protection manuelle avant un partage important."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过辅助功能检查 Zoom 和 Teams 的共享工具栏标题。客户端版本和语言可能导致不匹配；不覆盖系统共享、远程桌面、录屏和浏览器标签页。重要共享前请手动开启保护。"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prüft über Bedienungshilfen die Titel der Freigabe-Symbolleisten von Zoom und Teams. App-Versionen und Sprachen können abweichen. Systemfreigaben, Fernzugriff, Aufnahmen und Browser-Tabs werden nicht erfasst. Aktiviere vor wichtigen Bildschirmfreigaben den manuellen Schutz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
